-- prompt.md --
Implement the class `LRUCache` in `cachekit/lru.py`.

- `LRUCache(capacity)`: capacity is an integer of at least 1, else `ValueError`.
- `get(key, default=None)` returns the stored value (and marks the key as most recently used) or `default`.
- `put(key, value)` stores or replaces the value and marks the key as most recently used; when the cache then holds more than `capacity` keys, the least recently used key is dropped.
- `len(cache)` is the number of keys held.
